        "heading_7DMHNd": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Introducing Betty Romàn",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_p76qTz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>As a seasoned esthetician with 30 years experience and a 25 year spa owner, I have dedicated my career to the art and science of skincare.</p><p>My passion for European skincare methods inspired me to pursue advanced training in Paris, where I continue to travel to further my knowledge. I have worked closely with many professional skincare brands over the years. This inspired me to develop my own skincare products which reflect my commitment to offering our clients the best in skincare products, which are all natural from quality ingredients.</p><p>Recognizing the importance of education, I attended the renowned Aesthetic Skin Care Center in the D.C. area, one of the leading private skincare institutes of its time. There, I received European-based training with a holistic emphasis on treating the skin and body as an interconnected system. I also hold the internationally respected CIDESCO Diploma, a testament to my expertise and dedication to the highest standards in the skincare industry.</p><p>My goal has always been clear: \"I want my clients to feel and look beautiful every day, not just on spa day.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
