          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why I Created My Own Skincare Line",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_K6zMKY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With decades of experience as an aesthetician and spa owner I saw a void in the market for products that seamlessly combined European techniques, holistic principles, and effective results. While I worked with some of the best skincare brands in the industry, I realized that no single line fully met my clients’ unique needs.</p><p>Driven by my commitment to empowering clients to maintain beautiful, healthy skin at home, I designed my own skincare line. The products are thoughtfully crafted to embody the same principles that guide my spa treatments: high-quality ingredients, proven European methods, and a focus on holistic wellness.</p><p>My skincare line is more than a collection of products; it’s an extension of my philosophy and expertise, allowing my clients to bring the spa experience into their daily routines. My mission is simple: to help people achieve radiant, healthy skin every day, not just on spa days.</p>"
          }
        }
